From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pavel <pbuzdin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:47:28 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] wasm(imex,sql): VACUUM INTO / MemVfs backup path on wasm32

sqlite-wasm-rs is plain SQLite, so export_database and Sql::import
cannot call sqlcipher_export (#331). Without a passphrase, export uses
VACUUM INTO, copies the snapshot from MemVfs into tokio memfs for the
tar packer, and import loads a plaintext SQLite file back with
import_db. A passphrase or a SQLCipher-format file fails with a clear
error. Native path unchanged.

WASM-CORE: imex,sql.
Native impact: none (cfg(target_arch = "wasm32") only).
---
